#: includes/arrays.php servcheck_test.php
msgid "None"
msgstr "Geen"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Algemene instellings"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Service Check Name"
msgstr "Dienskontrolenaam"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The name that is displayed for this Service Check, and is included in any Alert notifications."
msgstr "Die naam wat vir hierdie Dienskontrole vertoon word, en in enige Alarmkennisgewings ingesluit word."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many attempts"
msgstr "Hoeveel pogings"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Cacti attempts to run each test multiple times. The first successful attempt ends the testing and records the success. If none of the attempts are successful, the test is terminated and a failure is recorded. High number causes log test duration."
msgstr "Cacti probeer om elke toets verskeie kere uit te voer. Die eerste suksesvolle poging beëindig die toetsing en teken die sukses aan. As geeneen van die pogings suksesvol is nie, word die toets gestaak en 'n mislukking word aangeteken. 'n Hoë getal veroorsaak lang toetsduur."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable test"
msgstr "Aktiveer toets"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Uncheck this box to disable this test from being checked."
msgstr "Ontmerk hierdie blokkie om kontrolering van hierdie toets te deaktiveer."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable run script for this test"
msgstr "Aktiveer die uitvoer van skrip vir hierdie toets"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If the global Command Execution function is enabled, you can set here whether the script should be run for this test or not."
msgstr "Indien die globale Opdraguitvoeringsfunksie geaktiveer is, kan u hier stel of die skrip vir hierdie toets uitgevoer moet word of nie."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Poller"
msgstr "Poller"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Poller on which the test will run"
msgstr "Poller waarop die toets sal loop"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Type of service"
msgstr "Tipe diens"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "What type of service?"
msgstr "Watter tipe diens?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "IP Address or DNS name of server"
msgstr "IP-adres of DNS-naam van bediener"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "You can specify another port (example.com:5000) otherwise default will be used. For IPv6 numeric address use [ip:ad:dr:es:fo:rma:at]. For DOH (DNS over HTTPS) use here name of server (example 10.10.10.10, cloudflare-dns.com, ..)"
msgstr "Jy kan 'n ander poort spesifiseer (example.com:5000), anders sal die verstekpoort gebruik word. Vir 'n numeriese IPv6-adres gebruik [ip:ad:dr:es:fo:rma:at]. Vir DOH (DNS oor HTTPS) gebruik hier die naam van die bediener (byvoorbeeld 10.10.10.10, cloudflare-dns.com, ..)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Resolve DNS to Address"
msgstr "Los DNS op na adres"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enter an IP Address to force DNS name to resolve to. Leaving blank will use DNS Resolution instead."
msgstr "Voer 'n IP-adres in waarna die DNS-naam geforseer moet word om op te los. As dit leeg gelaat word, sal DNS-oplossing eerder gebruik word."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Service settings"
msgstr "Diensinstellings"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Select correct credential"
msgstr "Kies die korrekte geloofsbrief"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP OID"
msgstr "SNMP-OID"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Insert SNMP OID"
msgstr "Voeg SNMP-OID in"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSH command"
msgstr "SSH-opdrag"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Insert SSH command with full path, result of command will be returned"
msgstr "Voeg SSH-opdrag met volle pad in; resultaat van opdrag sal teruggestuur word"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Your own CA and intermediate certs"
msgstr "Jou eie CA en tussensertifikate"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP Search"
msgstr "LDAP-soektog"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP search filter, it could be ,OU=anygroup,DC=example,DC=com"
msgstr "LDAP-soekfilter, dit kan ,OU=anygroup,DC=example,DC=com wees"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "DNS Name for Query"
msgstr "DNS-naam vir Navraag"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "DNS name for querying. For DOH (DNS over HTTPS) use /resolve?name=example.com or /dns-query?name=example.com&type=A. For plaintext DNS A and AAAA records will be returned"
msgstr "DNS-naam vir navraag. Vir DOH (DNS oor HTTPS), gebruik /resolve?name=example.com of /dns-query?name=example.com&type=A. Vir gewone teks-DNS sal A- en AAAA-rekords teruggestuur word"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Path Part of URL"
msgstr "Paddeel van URL"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For web service insert at least \"/\" or something like \"/any/path/\"."
msgstr "Vir webdiens, voeg ten minste \"/\" of iets soos \"/enige/pad/\" in."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Requires Authentication"
msgstr "Vereis verifikasie"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check this box if the site will normally return a 401 Error as it requires a username and password."
msgstr "Merk hierdie blokkie as die terrein normaalweg 'n 401-fout terugstuur omdat dit 'n gebruikersnaam en wagwoord vereis."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Proxy Server"
msgstr "Instaanbediener"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If this connection text requires a proxy, select it here.  Otherwise choose 'None'."
msgstr "Indien hierdie verbindingsteks 'n instaanbediener (proxy) vereis, kies dit hier.  Andersins kies 'Geen'."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check Certificate"
msgstr "Kontroleer Sertifikaat"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If using SSL, check this box if you want to validate the certificate. Default on, turn off if you the site uses a self-signed certificate."
msgstr "Indien SSL gebruik word, merk hierdie blokkie as u die sertifikaat wil valideer. By verstek aan; skakel af as die terrein 'n selfondertekende sertifikaat gebruik."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check and notify Certificate expiration"
msgstr "Kontroleer sertifikaatverval en stel in kennis"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If using SSL, check this box if you want to check the certificate expiration. You can set in settings how many days before expiration notify.."
msgstr "Indien SSL gebruik word, merk hierdie blokkie as u die sertifikaatvervaldatum wil nagaan. U kan in instellings stel hoeveel dae voor vervaldatum kennis gegee moet word."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How Often to Test"
msgstr "Hoe gereeld om te toets"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Test every xth poller run"
msgstr "Toets elke x-de Poller-lopie"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Trigger"
msgstr "Sneller"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many times the service must be DOWN before an alert email is triggered."
msgstr "Hoeveel keer die diens AF moet wees voordat 'n waarskuwings-e-pos geaktiveer word."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Long duration alert"
msgstr "Langduur-waarskuwing"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If the test time is greater than this value more times in a row, send a notification. Related to variable Duration count. The test inherits the maximum runtime from the settings. If a higher value is set here, the maximum runtime is this value + 2 seconds."
msgstr "Indien die toetstyd meer kere agtereenvolgens groter as hierdie waarde is, stuur 'n kennisgewing. Verwant aan die veranderlike Duurtelling. Die toets erf die maksimum looptyd vanaf die instellings. Indien 'n hoër waarde hier gestel word, is die maksimum looptyd hierdie waarde + 2 sekondes."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Number of duration violations in a row"
msgstr "Aantal duur-oortredings na mekaar"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many times the duration trigger must be exceeded in a row for a notification to be sent"
msgstr "Hoeveel keer agtereenvolgens die tydsduursneller oorskry moet word voordat 'n kennisgewing gestuur word"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Verification Strings"
msgstr "Verifikasiestringe"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Response Search String"
msgstr "Antwoordsoekstring"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the string to search for in the response for a live and working service."
msgstr "Dit is die string om in die reaksie na te soek vir 'n aktiewe en werkende diens."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Response Search String - Maintenance"
msgstr "Antwoordsoekstring - Onderhoud"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the string to search for on the Maintenance .  The Service Check will check for this string if the above string is not found.  If found, it means that the service is under maintenance."
msgstr "Dit is die string om na te soek vir Onderhoud. Die dienskontrole sal vir hierdie string kontroleer as bogenoemde string nie gevind word nie. Indien gevind, beteken dit dat die diens onder onderhoud is."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Response Search String - Failed"
msgstr "Antwoordsoekstring - Misluk"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the string to search for a known failure in the service response.  The Service Check will only alert if this string is found, ignoring any timeout issues and the search strings above."
msgstr "Dit is die string om na te soek vir 'n bekende mislukking in die diensreaksie. Die dienskontrole sal slegs 'n alarm gee as hierdie string gevind word, en enige tydsverstrekingsprobleme en die soekstringe hierbo ignoreer."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Notification Settings"
msgstr "Kennisgewinginstellings"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Email notification"
msgstr "E-poskennisgewing"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If enabled email notification about state, duration and search result will be send"
msgstr "Indien geaktiveer, sal e-poskennisgewing oor status, duur en soekresultaat gestuur word"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Notify Format"
msgstr "Kennisgewingformaat"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the format to use when sending the notification email"
msgstr "Dit is die formaat wat gebruik moet word wanneer die kennisgewing-e-pos gestuur word"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Notification List"
msgstr "Kennisgewingslys"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Use this Notification List for those to be notified when this service goes down."
msgstr "Gebruik hierdie kennisgewingslys vir diegene wat in kennis gestel moet word wanneer hierdie diens afgaan."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Notify Accounts"
msgstr "Stel rekeninge in kennis"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is a listing of accounts that will be notified when this service goes down."
msgstr "Dit is 'n lys van rekeninge wat in kennis gestel sal word wanneer hierdie diens afgaan."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Extra Alert Emails"
msgstr "Ekstra waarskuwings-e-posse"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "You may specify here extra Emails to receive alerts for this test (comma separated)"
msgstr "Jy kan hier ekstra E-posse spesifiseer om alarms vir hierdie toets te ontvang (komma-geskei)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "Notas"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Notes sent in email"
msgstr "Notas in e-pos gestuur"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "External ID"
msgstr "Eksterne ID"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enter an External ID for this test."
msgstr "Voer 'n Eksterne ID vir hierdie toets in."

