msgstr "Gebruikersnaam"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Password"
msgstr "Wagwoord"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For anonymous FTP insert email address"
msgstr "Vir anonieme FTP, voeg e-posadres in"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Login URL"
msgstr "Aanmeld-URL"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "URL which is used to log in or get the token."
msgstr "URL wat gebruik word om aan te meld of die teken te kry."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Data URL"
msgstr "Data-URL"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "URL to retrieve data. Insert with http:// or https://"
msgstr "URL om data te herwin. Voeg in met http:// of https://"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP v1 or v2 community"
msgstr "SNMP v1- of v2-gemeenskap"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP community string for SNMP v1 or v2(c)"
msgstr "SNMP-gemeenskapstring vir SNMP v1 of v2(c)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP Security Level"
msgstr "SNMP-sekuriteitsvlak"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP v3 Security Level to use when querying the device."
msgstr "SNMP v3-sekuriteitsvlak om te gebruik wanneer die toestel bevraagteken word."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP Auth Protocol (v3)"
msgstr "SNMP-verifikasieprotokol (v3)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Choose the SNMPv3 Authorization Protocol."
msgstr "Kies die SNMPv3-magtigingsprotokol."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP Username (v3)"
msgstr "SNMP-gebruikersnaam (v3)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP v3 username for this device."
msgstr "SNMP v3-gebruikersnaam vir hierdie toestel."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP Password (v3)"
msgstr "SNMP-wagwoord (v3)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP v3 password for this device."
msgstr "SNMP v3-wagwoord vir hierdie toestel."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP Privacy Protocol (v3)"
msgstr "SNMP-privaatheidsprotokol (v3)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Choose the SNMPv3 Privacy Protocol."
msgstr "Kies die SNMPv3-privaatheidsprotokol."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP Privacy Passphrase (v3)"
msgstr "SNMP-privaatheidswagfrase (v3)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Choose the SNMPv3 Privacy Passphrase."
msgstr "Kies die SNMPv3-privaatheidswagfrase."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP Context (v3)"
msgstr "SNMP-konteks (v3)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enter the SNMP Context to use for this device."
msgstr "Voer die SNMP-konteks in wat vir hierdie toestel gebruik moet word."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP Engine ID (v3)"
msgstr "SNMP-enjin-ID (v3)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enter the SNMP v3 Engine Id or empty."
msgstr "Voer die SNMP v3-enjin-ID in of laat leeg."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSH user"
msgstr "SSH-gebruiker"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Insert username here"
msgstr "Voeg gebruikersnaam hier in"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSH private key"
msgstr "SSH-privaatsleutel"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSH private key "
msgstr "SSH-privaatsleutel "

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSH private key passphrase"
msgstr "Wagwoordfrase vir SSH-privaatsleutel"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If your key is password protected, insert password here"
msgstr "Indien u sleutel met 'n wagwoord beskerm is, voeg wagwoord hier in"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Client ID"
msgstr "Kliënt-ID"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Oauth Client ID"
msgstr "OAuth-kliënt-ID"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Client secret"
msgstr "Kliëntgeheim"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "OAuth Client secret"
msgstr "OAuth-kliëntgeheim"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Token name"
msgstr "Token-naam"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Token value"
msgstr "Token-waarde"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "<b>Can be used for a lot of service checks:</b><br/><i>Http/https</i> - optional, when it is set, try HTTP basic auth<br/><i>SMTP on port 587</i> - optional. Without a username/password, only the server response is tested. With a username and password, login is also performed<br/><i>Imap, imaps, pop3, pop3s, ftp</i> - optional. For anonymous ftp, use username \"anonymous\" and email address as password<br/><i>LDAP, smb, smbs</i> - required<br/><i>MQTT</i> - optional<br/><i>SCP, SSH command</i> - you can use this method or private key method"
msgstr "<b>Kan vir baie dienstoetse gebruik word:</b><br/><i>Http/https</i> - opsioneel, wanneer dit gestel is, probeer HTTP basiese magtiging<br/><i>SMTP op poort 587</i> - opsioneel. Sonder 'n gebruikersnaam/wagwoord word slegs die bedienerrespons getoets. Met 'n gebruikersnaam en wagwoord word aanmelding ook uitgevoer<br/><i>Imap, imaps, pop3, pop3s, ftp</i> - opsioneel. Vir anonieme ftp, gebruik gebruikersnaam \"anonymous\" en e-posadres as wagwoord<br/><i>LDAP, smb, smbs</i> - vereis<br/><i>MQTT</i> - opsioneel<br/><i>SCP, SSH-opdrag</i> - jy kan hierdie metode of die privaatsleutel-metode gebruik"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - Basic HTTP auth. Username and password are required"
msgstr "Rest API - Basiese HTTP-verifikasie. Gebruikersnaam en wagwoord word vereis"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - API key auth<br/>Auth is sent in HTTP header, custom header or POST method. Credentials in URL are not supported.<br/>Insert API key name and value. Both values are required. For HTTP header the name <i>Bearer or apikey or \"\"</i> is usually used (Authorization: Bearer apivalue). For custom header <i>X-API-Key</i> is usually used (X-Api-Key: keyvalue). For POST <i>api_key</i> is usually used."
msgstr "Rest API - API-sleutelverifikasie<br/>Verifikasie word in HTTP-kopskrif, pasgemaakte kopskrif of POST-metode gestuur. Geloofsbriewe in URL word nie ondersteun nie.<br/>Voeg API-sleutelnaam en -waarde in. Beide waardes word vereis. Vir HTTP-kopskrif word die naam <i>Bearer of apikey of \"\"</i> gewoonlik gebruik (Authorization: Bearer apivalue). Vir pasgemaakte kopskrif word <i>X-API-Key</i> gewoonlik gebruik (X-Api-Key: keyvalue). Vir POST word <i>api_key</i> gewoonlik gebruik."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - OAuth2/Bearer token auth<br/>You can have key/token from server and insert it here or use auth flow with credentials. Username and password are sent Json encoded."
msgstr "Rest API - OAuth2/Bearer-tokenverifikasie<br/>Jy kan 'n sleutel/token vanaf die bediener kry en dit hier invoeg, of die verifikasievloei met geloofsbriewe gebruik. Gebruikersnaam en wagwoord word JSON-geënkodeer gestuur."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - Cookie based auth - both values are required. After login, cookie is returned"
msgstr "Rest API - Koekiegebaseerde verifikasie - beide waardes word vereis. Na aanmelding word koekie teruggestuur"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP v1 or v2 - required, insert community name here"
msgstr "SNMP v1 of v2 - vereis, voer gemeenskapsnaam hier in"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP v3 - The security level determines which parameters are required"
msgstr "SNMP v3 - Die sekuriteitsvlak bepaal watter parameters vereis word"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSH private key - Can be used for SCP or SSH command test. These test can use username/password too"
msgstr "SSH-privaatsleutel - Kan gebruik word vir SCP- of SSH-opdragtoets. Hierdie toetse kan ook gebruikersnaam/wagwoord gebruik"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "It only checks whether the web server is responding. If username/password credential is used, it will try Basic HTTP auth."
msgstr "Dit kontroleer slegs of die webbediener reageer. Indien gebruikersnaam/wagwoord-aanmeldbesonderhede gebruik word, sal dit Basiese HTTP-stawing probeer."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The same as HTTP plaintext but adds the ability to test certificates."
msgstr "Dieselfde as HTTP-gewone teks, maar voeg die vermoë by om sertifikate te toets."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "It only checks whether the SMTP server is responding. No authentication. You will see server login banner and ehlo response."
msgstr "Dit kontroleer slegs of die SMTP-bediener reageer. Geen stawing nie. U sal die bediener se aanmeldbanier en ehlo-respons sien."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted + STARTTLS. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate. Without username and password, you will see server login banner and ehlo response. With credential, login will be performed"
msgstr "Ongeënkripteer + STARTTLS. Dit is ook moontlik om die geldigheid van die sertifikaat te toets. Sonder gebruikersnaam en wagwoord sal jy die bedieneraanmeldbanier en ehlo-reaksie sien. Met aanmeldbesonderhede sal aanmelding uitgevoer word"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted connection on default port 465. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate. With username and password AUTH LOGIN will be tested."
msgstr "Geënkripteerde verbinding op verstekpoort 465. Dit is ook moontlik om die geldigheid van die sertifikaat te toets. Met gebruikersnaam en wagwoord sal AUTH LOGIN getoets word."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted IMAP connection. Without credential, only connection will be tested. You will see only login banner. With credential login will be tested and try to read list of messages. You can use AUTHENTICATE PLAIN or AUTHENTICATE LOGIN method."
msgstr "Ongeënkripteerde IMAP-verbinding. Sonder aanmeldbesonderhede sal slegs verbinding getoets word. Jy sal slegs aanmeldbanier sien. Met aanmeldbesonderhede sal aanmelding getoets word en probeer om lys van boodskappe te lees. Jy kan AUTHENTICATE PLAIN- of AUTHENTICATE LOGIN-metode gebruik."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The same as unencrypted IMAP but after login STARTTLS is used. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate after STARTTLS."
msgstr "Dieselfde as ongeënkripteerde IMAP, maar ná aanmelding word STARTTLS gebruik. Dit is ook moontlik om die geldigheid van die sertifikaat ná STARTTLS te toets."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted IMAP, you can try login and test certificate and user login"
msgstr "Geënkripteerde IMAP, u kan aanmelding probeer en sertifikaat en gebruikersaanmelding toets"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted POP3 connection. Without credential, only connection will be tested. You will see only login banner. With credential login will be tested and try to read list of messages"
msgstr "Ongeënkripteerde POP3-verbinding. Sonder aanmeldbesonderhede sal slegs verbinding getoets word. Jy sal slegs aanmeldbanier sien. Met aanmeldbesonderhede sal aanmelding getoets word en probeer om lys van boodskappe te lees"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The same as unencrypted POP3 but after login STARTTLS is used. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate after STARTTLS."
msgstr "Dieselfde as ongeënkripteerde POP3, maar ná aanmelding word STARTTLS gebruik. Dit is ook moontlik om die geldigheid van die sertifikaat ná STARTTLS te toets."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted POP3, you can try login and test certificate and user login."
msgstr "Geënkripteerde POP3, u kan aanmelding probeer en sertifikaat en gebruikersaanmelding toets."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try to resolve DNS record on specified DNS server"
msgstr "Probeer om DNS-rekord op die gespesifiseerde DNS-bediener op te los"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try DNS over HTTPS."
msgstr "Probeer DNS oor HTTPS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "All parameters are required. Perform unencrypted LDAP login and search"
msgstr "Alle parameters word vereis. Voer ongeënkripteerde LDAP-aanmelding en -soektog uit"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "All parameters are required. Perform encrypted LDAP login and search"
msgstr "Alle parameters word vereis. Voer geënkripteerde LDAP-aanmelding en -soektog uit"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted FTP connection, login and try to download file specified in path (/path/to/file.txt). For anonymous connection use login *anonymous* and email address as password. The content of the file is returned."
msgstr "Ongeënkripteerde FTP-verbinding, meld aan en probeer om die lêer wat in die pad (/path/to/file.txt) gespesifiseer is, af te laai. Vir anonieme verbinding gebruik aanmelding *anonymous* en e-posadres as wagwoord. Die inhoud van die lêer word teruggestuur."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try to download file specified in path (/path/to/file.txt) from TFTP server. The content of the file is returned."
msgstr "Probeer om die lêer wat in die pad (/path/to/file.txt) gespesifiseer is vanaf die TFTP-bediener af te laai. Die inhoud van die lêer word teruggestuur."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted SCP connection, login and try to download file specified in path (/path/to/file.txt)."
msgstr "Geënkripteerde SCP-verbinding, meld aan en probeer die lêer aflaai wat in die pad gespesifiseer is (/path/to/file.txt)."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try SMB protocol, username and password are required. Try to login and download file."
msgstr "Probeer SMB-protokol, gebruikersnaam en wagwoord word vereis. Probeer om aan te meld en lêer af te laai."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Connect to MQTT server and listen for any message. You can specify topic in Path (bedroom/temp), blank for any topic. For this test is recommended increase \"Long duration alert\""
msgstr "Verbind aan MQTT-bediener en luister vir enige boodskap. U kan onderwerp in Pad spesifiseer (bedroom/temp), leeg vir enige onderwerp. Vir hierdie toets word aanbeveel om \"Langdurige waarskuwing\" te verhoog"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with basic HTTP auth. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "REST API-toets met basiese HTTP-verifikasie. Berei eers aanmeldbesonderhede voor."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with API key auth. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "REST API-toets met API-sleutelverifikasie. Berei eers aanmeldbesonderhede voor."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with Oauth2. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "REST API-toets met OAuth2. Berei eers aanmeldbesonderhede voor."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with cookie auth. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "REST API-toets met koekieverifikasie. Berei eers aanmeldbesonderhede voor."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try SNMP get method. Output for specified OID is returned. Credential is required, you have to prepare SNMP v.1,2 or v3 credential first."
msgstr "Probeer SNMP get-metode. Afvoer vir gespesifiseerde OID word teruggestuur. Geloofsbrief word vereis; jy moet eers 'n SNMP v.1,2 of v3-geloofsbrief voorberei."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try SNMP walk method. Output for specified OID is returned. Credential is required, you have to prepare SNMP v.1,2 or v3 credential first."
msgstr "Probeer SNMP walk-metode. Afvoer vir gespesifiseerde OID word teruggestuur. Geloofsbrief word vereis; jy moet eers 'n SNMP v.1,2 of v3-geloofsbrief voorberei."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Use ssh and connect to remote host. After login run specified command and return output. Username and password or private key is possible."
msgstr "Gebruik ssh en koppel aan die afgeleë gasheer. Voer die gespesifiseerde opdrag na aanmelding uit en gee die uitvoer terug. Gebruikersnaam en wagwoord of privaatsleutel is moontlik."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SFTP protocol on port 22, username and password and path are required. Try to do directory listing of path."
msgstr "SFTP-protokol op poort 22, gebruikersnaam en wagwoord en pad word vereis. Probeer om 'n gidslys van die pad te maak."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "All fine. Proceed as usual."
msgstr "Alles is in orde. Gaan voort soos gewoonlik."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The URL you passed to libcurl used a protocol that this libcurl does not support. The support might be a compile-time option that you did not use, it can be a misspelled protocol string or just a protocol libcurl has no code for."
msgstr "Die URL wat u aan libcurl deurgegee het, gebruik 'n protokol wat hierdie libcurl nie ondersteun nie. Die ondersteuning is dalk 'n kompileringstyd-opsie wat u nie gebruik het nie, dit kan 'n verkeerd gespelde protokolstring wees, of bloot 'n protokol waarvoor libcurl geen kode het nie."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Early initialization code failed. This is likely to be an internal error or problem, or a resource problem where something fundamental could not get done at init time."
msgstr "Vroeë inisialiseringskode het misluk. Dit is waarskynlik 'n interne fout of probleem, of 'n hulpbronprobleem waar iets fundamenteels nie tydens inisialisering gedoen kon word nie."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The URL was not properly formatted."
msgstr "Die URL was nie behoorlik geformateer nie."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A requested feature, protocol or option was not found built-in in this libcurl due to a build-time decision. This means that a feature or option was not enabled or explicitly disabled when libcurl was built and in order to get it to function you have to get a rebuilt libcurl."
msgstr "'n Versoekte kenmerk, protokol of opsie is nie ingebou in hierdie libcurl gevind nie weens 'n boutyd-besluit. Dit beteken dat 'n kenmerk of opsie nie geaktiveer is of uitdruklik gedeaktiveer is toe libcurl gebou is nie, en om dit te laat werk moet jy 'n herboude libcurl kry."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Could not resolve proxy. The given proxy host could not be resolved."
msgstr "Kon nie instaanbediener oplos nie. Die gegewe instaanbediener-gasheer kon nie opgelos word nie."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Could not resolve host. The given remote host was not resolved."
msgstr "Kon nie gasheer oplos nie. Die gegewe afgeleë gasheer kon nie opgelos word nie."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to connect() to host or proxy."
msgstr "Kon nie met connect() aan gasheer of instaanbediener koppel nie."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The server sent data libcurl could not parse. This error code was known as CURLE_FTP_WEIRD_SERVER_REPLY before 7.51.0."
msgstr "Die bediener het data gestuur wat libcurl nie kon ontleed nie. Hierdie foutkode was voor 7.51.0 bekend as CURLE_FTP_WEIRD_SERVER_REPLY."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "We were denied access to the resource given in the URL. For FTP, this occurs while trying to change to the remote directory."
msgstr "Toegang tot die hulpbron wat in die URL gegee is, is geweier. Vir FTP gebeur dit wanneer daar probeer word om na die afgeleë gids te verander."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "While waiting for the server to connect back when an active FTP session is used, an error code was sent over the control connection or similar."
msgstr "Terwyl gewag is dat die bediener terugkoppel wanneer 'n aktiewe FTP-sessie gebruik word, is 'n foutkode oor die beheerverbinding gestuur of soortgelyk."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "After having sent the FTP password to the server, libcurl expects a proper reply. This error code indicates that an unexpected code was returned."
msgstr "Nadat die FTP-wagwoord na die bediener gestuur is, verwag libcurl 'n behoorlike antwoord. Hierdie foutkode dui aan dat 'n onverwagte kode teruggestuur is."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "During an active FTP session while waiting for the server to connect, the CURLOPT_ACCEPTTIMEOUT_MS (or the internal default) timeout expired."
msgstr "Tydens 'n aktiewe FTP-sessie terwyl daar gewag is dat die bediener koppel, het die CURLOPT_ACCEPTTIMEOUT_MS- (of die interne verstek-) uitteltyd verstryk."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Libcurl failed to get a sensible result back from the server as a response to either a PASV or a EPSV command. The server is flawed."
msgstr "Libcurl kon nie 'n sinvolle resultaat van die bediener terugkry as antwoord op 'n PASV- of EPSV-bevel nie. Die bediener is gebrekkig."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "FTP servers return a 227-line as a response to a PASV command. If libcurl fails to parse that line, this return code is passed back."
msgstr "FTP-bedieners stuur 'n 227-reël terug as antwoord op 'n PASV-opdrag. As libcurl nie daardie reël kan ontleed nie, word hierdie terugkeerkode teruggestuur."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An internal failure to lookup the host used for the new connection."
msgstr "'n Interne mislukking om die gasheer wat vir die nuwe verbinding gebruik word, op te soek."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A problem was detected in the HTTP2 framing layer. This is somewhat generic and can be one out of several problems, see the error buffer for details."
msgstr "'n Probleem is in die HTTP2-raamlaag bespeur. Dit is taamlik generies en kan een van verskeie probleme wees; sien die foutbuffer vir besonderhede."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Received an error when trying to set the transfer mode to binary or ASCII."
msgstr "'n Fout het voorgekom tydens die poging om die oordragmodus na binêr of ASCII te stel."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A file transfer was shorter or larger than expected. This happens when the server first reports an expected transfer size, and then delivers data that does not match the previously given size."
msgstr "'n Lêeroordrag was korter of groter as wat verwag is. Dit gebeur wanneer die bediener eers 'n verwagte oordraggrootte rapporteer en dan data lewer wat nie met die voorheen gegewe grootte ooreenstem nie."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This was either a weird reply to a 'RETR' command or a zero byte transfer complete."
msgstr "Dit was óf 'n vreemde antwoord op 'n 'RETR'-opdrag óf 'n nulgreep-oordrag wat voltooi is."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Obsolete Error"
msgstr "Verouderde fout"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Not used in modern versions."
msgstr "Nie in moderne weergawes gebruik nie."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When sending custom \"QUOTE\" commands to the remote server, one of the commands returned an error code that was 400 or higher (for FTP) or otherwise indicated unsuccessful completion of the command."
msgstr "Tydens die stuur van pasgemaakte \"QUOTE\"-opdragte na die afgeleë bediener, het een van die opdragte 'n foutkode van 400 of hoër (vir FTP) teruggestuur of andersins aangedui dat die opdrag nie suksesvol voltooi is nie."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is returned if CURLOPT_FAILONERROR is set true and the HTTP server returns an error code that is >= 400."
msgstr "Dit word teruggestuur as CURLOPT_FAILONERROR op waar gestel is en die HTTP-bediener 'n foutkode >= 400 terugstuur."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An error occurred when writing received data to a local file, or an error was returned to libcurl from a write callback."
msgstr "'n Fout het voorgekom tydens die skryf van ontvangde data na 'n plaaslike lêer, of 'n fout is vanaf 'n skryf-terugroepfunksie aan libcurl teruggestuur."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed starting the upload. For FTP, the server typically denied the STOR command. The error buffer usually contains the server's explanation for this."
msgstr "Kon nie die oplaai begin nie. Vir FTP het die bediener gewoonlik die STOR-opdrag geweier. Die foutbuffer bevat gewoonlik die bediener se verduideliking hiervoor."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "There was a problem reading a local file or an error returned by the read callback."
msgstr "Daar was 'n probleem met die lees van 'n plaaslike lêer of 'n fout is deur die lees-terugroepfunksie teruggestuur."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A memory allocation request failed. This is serious badness and things are severely screwed up if this ever occurs."
msgstr "'n Geheuetoekenningsversoek het misluk. Dit is 'n ernstige fout en sake is erg verkeerd as dit ooit gebeur."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Operation timeout. The specified time-out period was reached according to the conditions."
msgstr "Tydsverloop vir bewerking. Die gespesifiseerde tydsbeperking is volgens die voorwaardes bereik."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The FTP PORT command returned error. This mostly happens when you have not specified a good enough address for libcurl to use. See CURLOPT_FTPPORT."
msgstr "Die FTP PORT-opdrag het 'n fout teruggestuur. Dit gebeur meestal wanneer jy nie 'n goeie genoeg adres vir libcurl gespesifiseer het om te gebruik nie. Sien CURLOPT_FTPPORT."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The FTP REST command returned error. This should never happen if the server is sane."
msgstr "Die FTP REST-opdrag het 'n fout teruggestuur. Dit behoort nooit te gebeur as die bediener reg funksioneer nie."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The server does not support or accept range requests."
msgstr "Die bediener ondersteun of aanvaar nie reeksversoeke nie."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is an odd error that mainly occurs due to internal confusion."
msgstr "Dit is 'n vreemde fout wat hoofsaaklik weens interne verwarring voorkom."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A problem occurred somewhere in the SSL/TLS handshake. You really want the error buffer and read the message there as it pinpoints the problem slightly more. Could be certificates (file formats, paths, permissions), passwords, and others."
msgstr "'n Probleem het iewers in die SSL/TLS-handdruk voorgekom. Jy behoort die foutbuffer na te gaan en die boodskap daar te lees aangesien dit die probleem effens nader uitwys. Dit kan sertifikate (lêerformate, paaie, toestemmings), wagwoorde en ander dinge wees."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The download could not be resumed because the specified offset was out of the file boundary."
msgstr "Die aflaai kon nie hervat word nie omdat die gespesifiseerde verskuiwing buite die lêergrens was."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A file given with FILE:// could not be opened. Most likely because the file path does not identify an existing file. Did you check file permissions?"
msgstr "'n Lêer wat met FILE:// gegee is, kon nie oopgemaak word nie. Heel waarskynlik omdat die lêerpad nie 'n bestaande lêer aandui nie. Het jy lêertoestemmings nagegaan?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP cannot bind. LDAP bind operation failed."
msgstr "LDAP kan nie bind nie. LDAP-bindbewerking het misluk."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP search failed."
msgstr "LDAP-soektog het misluk."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Function not found. A required zlib function was not found."
msgstr "Funksie nie gevind nie. 'n Vereiste zlib-funksie is nie gevind nie."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Aborted by callback. A callback returned \"abort\" to libcurl."
msgstr "Deur terugroepfunksie gestaak. 'n Terugroepfunksie het \"abort\" aan libcurl teruggestuur."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A function was called with a bad parameter."
msgstr "'n Funksie is met 'n ongeldige parameter geroep."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Interface error. A specified outgoing interface could not be used. Set which interface to use for outgoing connections' source IP address with URLOPT_INTERFACE."
msgstr "Koppelvlakfout. 'n Gespesifiseerde uitgaande koppelvlak kon nie gebruik word nie. Stel watter koppelvlak gebruik moet word vir die bron-IP-adres van uitgaande verbindings met URLOPT_INTERFACE."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Too many redirects. When following redirects, libcurl hit the maximum amount. Set your limit with CURLOPT_MAXREDIRS."
msgstr "Te veel herleidings. Tydens die volg van herleidings het libcurl die maksimum aantal bereik. Stel u limiet met CURLOPT_MAXREDIRS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An option passed to libcurl is not recognized/known. Refer to the appropriate documentation. This is most likely a problem in the program that uses libcurl. The error buffer might contain more specific information about which exact option it concerns."
msgstr "'n Opsie wat aan libcurl deurgegee is, word nie herken nie/is onbekend. Verwys na die toepaslike dokumentasie. Dit is heel waarskynlik 'n probleem in die program wat libcurl gebruik. Die foutbuffer kan meer spesifieke inligting bevat oor presies watter opsie dit betref."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An option passed in to a setopt was wrongly formatted. See error message for details about what option."
msgstr "'n Opsie wat aan setopt deurgegee is, is verkeerd geformateer. Sien die foutboodskap vir besonderhede oor watter opsie."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Nothing was returned from the server, and under the circumstances, getting nothing is considered an error."
msgstr "Niks is vanaf die bediener teruggestuur nie, en onder die omstandighede word die verkryging van niks as 'n fout beskou."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The specified crypto engine was not found."
msgstr "Die gespesifiseerde kripto-enjin is nie gevind nie."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed setting the selected SSL crypto engine as default."
msgstr "Kon nie die gekose SSL-kripto-enjin as verstek stel nie."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed sending network data."
msgstr "Kon nie netwerkdata stuur nie."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failure with receiving network data."
msgstr "Fout tydens ontvangs van netwerkdata."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "problem with the local client certificate."
msgstr "probleem met die plaaslike kliëntsertifikaat."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Could not use specified cipher."
msgstr "Kon nie gespesifiseerde syfer gebruik nie."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The remote server's SSL certificate or SSH fingerprint was deemed not OK. This error code has been unified with CURLE_SSL_CACERT since 7.62.0. Its previous value was 51."
msgstr "Die afgeleë bediener se SSL-sertifikaat of SSH-vingerafdruk is nie as goed genoeg beskou nie. Hierdie foutkode is sedert 7.62.0 met CURLE_SSL_CACERT verenig. Die vorige waarde daarvan was 51."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unrecognized transfer encoding."
msgstr "Onherkende oordragkodering."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Maximum file size exceeded."
msgstr "Maksimum lêergrootte oorskry."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Requested FTP SSL level failed."
msgstr "Versoekte FTP SSL-vlak het misluk."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When doing a send operation curl had to rewind the data to retransmit, but the rewinding operation failed."
msgstr "Tydens 'n stuurbewerking moes curl die data terugspoel om weer te stuur, maar die terugspoelbewerking het misluk."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Initiating the SSL Engine failed."
msgstr "Inisiëring van die SSL-enjin het misluk."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The remote server denied curl to login (Added in 7.13.1)"
msgstr "Die afgeleë bediener het curl geweier om aan te meld (Bygevoeg in 7.13.1)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "File not found on TFTP server."
msgstr "Lêer nie op TFTP-bediener gevind nie."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Permission problem on TFTP server."
msgstr "Toestemmingsprobleem op TFTP-bediener."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Out of disk space on the server."
msgstr "Skyfspasie op die bediener is op."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Illegal TFTP operation."
msgstr "Onwettige TFTP-bewerking."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unknown TFTP transfer ID."
msgstr "Onbekende TFTP-oordrag-ID."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "File already exists and is not overwritten."
msgstr "Lêer bestaan reeds en word nie oorskryf nie."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This error should never be returned by a properly functioning TFTP server."
msgstr "Hierdie fout behoort nooit deur 'n behoorlik werkende TFTP-bediener teruggestuur te word nie."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Problem with reading the SSL CA cert (path? access rights?)"
msgstr "Probleem met die lees van die SSL CA-sertifikaat (pad? toegangsregte?)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The resource referenced in the URL does not exist."
msgstr "Die hulpbron waarna in die URL verwys word, bestaan nie."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An unspecified error occurred during the SSH session."
msgstr "'n Ongespesifiseerde fout het tydens die SSH-sessie voorgekom."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to shut down the SSL connection."
msgstr "Kon nie die SSL-verbinding afskakel nie."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Socket is not ready for send/recv wait till it's ready and try again. This return code is only returned from curl_easy_recv and curl_easy_send (Added in 7.18.2)"
msgstr "Sok is nie gereed vir stuur/ontvang nie; wag tot dit gereed is en probeer weer. Hierdie terugkeerkode word slegs deur curl_easy_recv en curl_easy_send teruggestuur (Bygevoeg in 7.18.2)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to load CRL file (Added in 7.19.0)"
msgstr "Kon nie CRL-lêer laai nie (Bygevoeg in 7.19.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Issuer check failed (Added in 7.19.0)"
msgstr "Uitreikerkontrole het misluk (bygevoeg in 7.19.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The FTP server does not understand the PRET command at all or does not support the given argument. Be careful when using CURLOPT_CUSTOMREQUEST, a custom LIST command is sent with the PRET command before PASV as well. (Added in 7.20.0)"
msgstr "Die FTP-bediener verstaan glad nie die PRET-opdrag nie of ondersteun nie die gegewe argument nie. Wees versigtig wanneer CURLOPT_CUSTOMREQUEST gebruik word; 'n pasgemaakte LIST-opdrag word ook met die PRET-opdrag voor PASV gestuur. (Bygevoeg in 7.20.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Mismatch of RTSP CSeq numbers."
msgstr "Wanpassing van RTSP CSeq-nommers."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Mismatch of RTSP Session Identifiers."
msgstr "Wanpassing van RTSP-sessie-identifiseerders."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unable to parse FTP file list (during FTP wildcard downloading)."
msgstr "Kan nie FTP-lêerlys ontleed nie (tydens FTP-jokertekenaflaai)."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Chunk callback reported error."
msgstr "Stuk-terugroepfunksie het 'n fout aangemeld."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "(For internal use only, is never returned by libcurl) No connection available, the session is queued. (added in 7.30.0)"
msgstr "(Slegs vir interne gebruik, word nooit deur libcurl teruggestuur nie) Geen verbinding beskikbaar nie, die sessie is in die waglys geplaas. (bygevoeg in 7.30.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to match the pinned key specified with CURLOPT_PINNEDPUBLICKEY."
msgstr "Kon nie by die vasgespelde sleutel pas wat met CURLOPT_PINNEDPUBLICKEY gespesifiseer is nie."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Status returned failure when asked with CURLOPT_SSL_VERIFYSTATUS."
msgstr "Status het mislukking teruggestuur toe daar met CURLOPT_SSL_VERIFYSTATUS navraag gedoen is."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Stream error in the HTTP/2 framing layer."
msgstr "Stroomfout in die HTTP/2-raamlaag."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An API function was called from inside a callback."
msgstr "'n API-funksie is vanuit 'n terugroepfunksie aangeroep."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An authentication function returned an error."
msgstr "'n Verifikasiefunksie het 'n fout teruggestuur."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A problem was detected in the HTTP/3 layer. This is somewhat generic and can be one out of several problems, see the error buffer for details."
msgstr "'n Probleem is in die HTTP/3-laag bespeur. Dit is taamlik generies en kan een van verskeie probleme wees; sien die foutbuffer vir besonderhede."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "QUIC connection error. This error may be caused by an SSL library error. QUIC is the protocol used for HTTP/3 transfers."
msgstr "QUIC-verbindingsfout. Hierdie fout kan deur 'n SSL-biblioteekfout veroorsaak word. QUIC is die protokol wat vir HTTP/3-oordragte gebruik word."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Proxy handshake error. CURLINFO_PROXY_ERROR provides extra details on the specific problem."
msgstr "Instaanbediener-handdrukfout. CURLINFO_PROXY_ERROR verskaf ekstra besonderhede oor die spesifieke probleem."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSL Client Certificate required."
msgstr "SSL-kliëntsertifikaat word vereis."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An internal call to poll() or select() returned error that is not recoverable."
msgstr "'n Interne aanroep na poll() of select() het 'n onherstelbare fout teruggestuur."

